#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:4
#: 67acaecf2de2465ebf01cea1e3d9ce90
msgid ""
"Two-dimensional acoustic **phononic-crystal** examples in "
"``examples/wave/phononic_crystal_2d/``: Bloch-Floquet band structures and a "
"finite-slab transmission spectrum, each validated against a committed COMSOL"
" reference. They showcase :class:`~tensormesh.BlochReducer` — the Bloch-"
"Floquet periodic boundary-condition operator, the periodic counterpart of "
":class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` — combined with the scalar Helmholtz assembly"
" from :doc:`complex` and the complex sparse eigensolve."
msgstr ""
"二维声学\\ **声子晶体**\\ 算例位于 ``examples/wave/phononic_crystal_2d/``\\ ：布洛赫-"
"弗洛凯能带结构与有限平板透射谱，均与提交的 COMSOL 参考解进行了验证。这些算例展示了 "
":class:`~tensormesh.BlochReducer` —— 布洛赫-弗洛凯周期性边界条件算子，即 "
":class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` 的周期版本 —— 结合 :doc:`complex` "
"中的标量亥姆霍兹装配与复稀疏特征值求解。"

