#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:61
#: ecb194ad623844e1879c6a8a32fa9fe2
msgid ""
"The two band-structure scripts differ in the physics, not the pipeline:"
msgstr "两个能带结构脚本的区别在于物理模型，而非流程："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:64
#: eb7a83d8e55340f0a72357cef26e3a0d
msgid ""
"**Square lattice, rigid cylinders** — sound-hard inclusions are meshed as "
"holes (natural Neumann boundary), so the operators are the plain "
"Laplace/mass pair :math:`K p = (\\omega/c)^2 M p`; path "
":math:`M\\!-\\!\\Gamma\\!-\\!X\\!-\\!M`."
msgstr ""
"**正方晶格，刚性圆柱** —— 声硬夹杂被网格化为孔洞（自然诺伊曼边界），因此算子为普通的拉普拉斯/质量矩阵对 :math:`K p = "
"(\\omega/c)^2 M p`\\ ；路径 :math:`M\\!-\\!\\Gamma\\!-\\!X\\!-\\!M`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:68
#: c6cd15f568424945bcd3f96bdb2b7a1f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Triangular lattice, penetrable steel** — the material varies in space, so "
"the operators are **weighted**: "
":math:`K_{ij}=\\int\\frac1\\rho\\nabla\\phi_i\\!\\cdot\\!\\nabla\\phi_j`, "
":math:`M_{ij}=\\int\\frac1{\\rho c^2}\\phi_i\\phi_j`, assembled with a "
"custom :class:`~tensormesh.ElementAssembler` carrying per-element "
":math:`1/\\rho` and :math:`1/(\\rho c^2)` over a conformal steel/water mesh;"
" non-orthogonal lattice vectors, path "
":math:`M\\!-\\!\\Gamma\\!-\\!K\\!-\\!M`."
msgstr ""
"**三角晶格，可穿透钢** —— 材料随空间变化，因此算子为\\ **加权**\\ 形式：\\ "
":math:`K_{ij}=\\int\\frac1\\rho\\nabla\\phi_i\\!\\cdot\\!\\nabla\\phi_j`\\ "
"，\\ :math:`M_{ij}=\\int\\frac1{\\rho c^2}\\phi_i\\phi_j`\\ ，通过自定义的 "
":class:`~tensormesh.ElementAssembler` 装配，该装配器在每个单元上携带 :math:`1/\\rho` 和 "
":math:`1/(\\rho c^2)`\\ ，基于共形的钢/水网格；非正交晶格矢量，路径 "
":math:`M\\!-\\!\\Gamma\\!-\\!K\\!-\\!M`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:77
#: b4af9b2e74d9416aa25151e4236a316c
msgid ""
"The unit-cell meshes use gmsh ``setPeriodic`` (and ``fragment`` for the two-"
"domain case) so opposite edges carry matching nodes — the precondition "
"``BlochReducer`` needs."
msgstr ""
"元胞网格使用 gmsh 的 ``setPeriodic``\\ （双域情况使用 ``fragment``\\ ），使得相对的边具有匹配的节点 —— 这是"
" ``BlochReducer`` 所需的前提条件。"

