#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:101
#: cf61673feb08431ebd41c5b66bc5251c
msgid "Transmission through a finite slab"
msgstr "有限平板的透射"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:103
#: ecb132d41203410bb7bea4621b7c496b
msgid ""
"``transmission_slab.py`` leaves the infinite-crystal setting: a normally-"
"incident plane wave (:math:`p_0 = 1` Pa) crosses a finite slab of rigid "
"cylinders, and the power transmission "
":math:`T(f)=\\langle|p|^2\\rangle_{\\mathrm{out}}/|p_0|^2` is swept over "
"frequency:"
msgstr ""
"``transmission_slab.py`` 离开了无限晶体设定：正入射平面波（\\ :math:`p_0 = 1` "
"Pa）穿过刚性圆柱的有限平板，功率透射系数 "
":math:`T(f)=\\langle|p|^2\\rangle_{\\mathrm{out}}/|p_0|^2` 在频域上扫描："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:113
#: 3274090123964b8894710358cbeef3b2
msgid ""
"The first-order radiation term :math:`B` and the incident load "
":math:`e_{\\mathrm{in}}` are hand-rolled boundary line integrals (no PML — "
"this matches COMSOL's first-order \"Plane Wave Radiation\" condition), and "
"each frequency is one complex sparse solve. Inside the band gap the "
"transmission drops to :math:`\\sim 0`; in the pass bands it recovers with "
"Fabry-Pérot ripples."
msgstr ""
"一阶辐射项 :math:`B` 与入射载荷 :math:`e_{\\mathrm{in}}` 为手工编写的边界线积分（无 PML —— 这与 "
"COMSOL 的一阶\"平面波辐射\"条件一致），每个频率对应一次复稀疏求解。在带隙内透射降至 :math:`\\sim 0`\\ "
"；在通带内则随法布里-珀罗振荡恢复。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:120
#: d2ef1e5c58a34916a2bfc6c551860c72
msgid "Transmission spectrum of a finite phononic slab vs COMSOL"
msgstr "有限声子平板的透射谱与 COMSOL 对比"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/phononic_crystal.rst:124
#: e017dd2340384c1e89730855479f998a
msgid ""
"Output of ``transmission_slab.py``: the slab geometry (left) and the "
"transmission spectrum :math:`T(f)` (right) with the COMSOL reference "
"overlaid — the band gap appears as the deep notch."
msgstr ""
"``transmission_slab.py`` 的输出：平板几何（左）与透射谱 :math:`T(f)`\\ （右），叠加了 COMSOL 参考解 "
"—— 带隙表现为深谷。"

